  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 592270,
    "RowId": 34700,
    "Text": "Defeat Hegemone"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 592298,
    "RowId": 34701,
    "Text": "Abyssos is my charge, and I shall not shirk my duty!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 592362,
    "RowId": 34702,
    "Text": "Rot from the inside out."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 592398,
    "RowId": 34703,
    "Text": "Be swept away in a flood of aether!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 592446,
    "RowId": 34704,
    "Text": "Waste away."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 592470,
    "RowId": 34705,
    "Text": "You cannot measure against a keyward!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 592518,
    "RowId": 34706,
    "Text": "This is but the beginning!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 592558,
    "RowId": 34707,
    "Text": "Your own body betrays you!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 592598,
    "RowId": 34708,
    "Text": "Your time draws near. Witness true mastery before your end!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 592670,
    "RowId": 34709,
    "Text": "Abyssos is my domain! I shall suffer your intrusion no longer!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 592746,
    "RowId": 34800,
    "Text": "Protect the Holy See of Ishgard"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 592790,
    "RowId": 34801,
    "Text": "Drive back the Dravanian Horde"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 592834,
    "RowId": 34802,
    "Text": "Stave off Vishap's advance"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 592874,
    "RowId": 34803,
    "Text": "Drive back the Dravanian Horde"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 592918,
    "RowId": 34804,
    "Text": "Stave off Vishap's advance"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 592958,
    "RowId": 34805,
    "Text": "Drive back the Dravanian Horde"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 593002,
    "RowId": 34806,
    "Text": "Stave off Vishap's advance"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 593042,
    "RowId": 34807,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 593054,
    "RowId": 34808,
    "Text": "Fall back and avoid Vishap's assault"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 593102,
    "RowId": 34809,
    "Text": "Regroup with the rear guard"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 593142,
    "RowId": 34810,
    "Text": "Defeat Vishap before the knights lose their resolve"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 593206,
    "RowId": 34811,
    "Text": "We claim victory this day, or Ishgard falls!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 593262,
    "RowId": 34812,
    "Text": "Accept the Fury into your heart, and defend this bridge with your life's blood!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 593354,
    "RowId": 34813,
    "Text": "They mean to destroy the wards of Daniffen's Collar. Let not a single dragon pass!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 593450,
    "RowId": 34814,
    "Text": "Have the rear guard ready the cannons!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 593502,
    "RowId": 34815,
    "Text": "Everyone, fall back! Fall back <i>now</i>!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 593558,
    "RowId": 34816,
    "Text": "Do not let it reach the barrier! Hold your ground!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 593622,
    "RowId": 34817,
    "Text": "Remember what it is we fight for!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 593666,
    "RowId": 34818,
    "Text": "Fall back, and regroup! The battle is not yet lost!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 593730,
    "RowId": 34819,
    "Text": "We... We've lost... Ishgard will burn..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 593782,
    "RowId": 34820,
    "Text": "The final ward is weakened. Hurry, we must end this now!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 593850,
    "RowId": 34821,
    "Text": "We are the shield that keeps the Holy See! Even if it should cost us everything, they cannot be suffered to pass!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 593974,
    "RowId": 34822,
    "Text": "They mean to defeat us with sheer numbers, then?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 594034,
    "RowId": 34823,
    "Text": "Well, it's a good thing I can't count!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 594086,
    "RowId": 34824,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 594098,
    "RowId": 34825,
    "Text": "We must defeat their champion at all costs!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 594154,
    "RowId": 34826,
    "Text": "Fall back! There's nothing left to be done here."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 594214,
    "RowId": 34827,
    "Text": "The second ward has fallen!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 594254,
    "RowId": 34828,
    "Text": "The first ward has been breached!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 594298,
    "RowId": 34829,
    "Text": "Hold your ground! Should this barrier fall, Ishgard will be awash in flame!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 594386,
    "RowId": 34830,
    "Text": "Dragoons, to arms! Give the enemy no quarter!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 594442,
    "RowId": 34831,
    "Text": "They will know the wrath of the Azure Dragoon!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 594502,
    "RowId": 34832,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 594514,
    "RowId": 34833,
    "Text": "Hold nothing back!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 594546,
    "RowId": 34834,
    "Text": "Our enemy is not without weakness! Keep it up!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 594606,
    "RowId": 34835,
    "Text": "Focus your attacks on the armored dragon!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 594658,
    "RowId": 34836,
    "Text": "They'll need more than thick hides to prevail over us."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 594726,
    "RowId": 34837,
    "Text": "Damn this infernal heat!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 594762,
    "RowId": 34838,
    "Text": "Ishgard will not fall. Not today!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 594806,
    "RowId": 34839,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 594818,
    "RowId": 34840,
    "Text": "I... I cannot hold on much longer..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 594866,
    "RowId": 34841,
    "Text": "We will see to things here, <split(<String>ObjectParameter(1)</String>, ,1)>. Fall back and help the others guard the ward."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 594970,
    "RowId": 34842,
    "Text": "Yda and I have matters here well in hand. <split(<String>ObjectParameter(1)</String>, ,1)>, you must go and see to the final ward."
  },
